  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership to engage older people and civil cosity organizations in policy discussions and advocacy on the social protection floor agenda and social pensions in Lebanon (BEY/HD - Implementation Agreement with HelpAge International on social protection in</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enter text ....</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the framework of the
UN joint program on Transforming national dialogue for the development of an inclusive
national social protection system for Lebanon, and building on previous collaboration between ILO and Helpage in developing a position paper reflecting the need and demand for establishing social pensions in Lebanon, this partnership would aim to achieve the following
objectives:
- To enable older people, including marginalized older women and men, to actively participate
in and influence discussions on the design and implementation of lifecycle social grants in
Lebanon;
- To engage stakeholders and diverse civil society organizations on the needs of older people
for life-cycle social protection; and
- To advocate for the establishment of social pensions in Lebanon, as part of an inclusive and
rights-based social protection system..</narrative>
  </description>
